      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">6. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Dad Tax</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3878ce69-e192-4d7b-b79b-f9340044227d">
      <Text>Jasper finishes setting up tents.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7968c8e1-0b96-46ea-9512-1b63e73745e8">
      <Text>Shelby and Lizzie stare in awe as Lulu and Petoskey feel awful.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="925a06bd-b395-4678-ab73-1523ed948520">
      <Text>Shelby</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26bb4f01-2c39-4622-8ea6-9ffbd07fd418">
      <Text>Thanks for everything, Jasper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c9f131de-96ae-442a-ba75-ae1f78b715c3">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed8453af-5b0e-4e43-809e-ab680db945eb">
      <Text>I really did not need your help.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4aff2b0a-5aa0-4637-97a8-97a70000c626">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d11c20a8-a2a8-4eae-9ea5-a8be54cc9528">
      <Text>You needed all the help you can get, Lulu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="540c5545-450f-4929-8cc3-0c935e1356e4">
      <Text>JASPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7f52f028-452c-40fd-8e48-7395c8634c90">
      <Text>And you needed manpower.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b4e907a-5533-4f66-a0f5-29a9784f289f">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="557b31af-bce2-43db-b6ac-ace238c46c99">
      <Text>Ha! He called you a sissy, Petoskey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="504a6d98-2fd4-49c7-a67f-a6083c919444">
      <Text>Lizzie</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="511a607b-e4b4-40d4-af04-cdbb467190e0">
      <Text>How could we ever repay you?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8db77b1f-842f-44dc-a292-8061552418f2">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b2fe0e3-e0f5-4593-bc09-0d6070aba8ae">
      <Text>Your sweetness is good ‘</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">nough</Text>
      <Text> for me.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8f7d8fe1-0fd5-4574-bde5-5d94805b7957">
      <Text>Jasper nabs a handful of candy from Lulu and Petoskey’s box.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4677a486-9731-458b-9e13-4e1cffbc28af">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="27a12845-23bb-43e6-884e-b20921a0218d">
      <Text>That’s </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">my</Text>
      <Text> candy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fe3b74c1-e9f0-4fb1-a442-358567e3ae86">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey stare down one another as they fight for the box.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="106a1917-8964-4dfa-9898-ed495a9ca277">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="50c2de72-5637-4e26-8b04-40e60b829e93">
      <Text>Mine! My sweets! Sugar! Mine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8ce617f6-cb86-4a88-960c-12d5416f71dd">
      <Text>Jasper takes their box away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90073f92-a825-465a-b6cb-946be7a0f02b">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dce46cb2-77ea-4d45-9147-ef07f5675107">
      <Text>In the jurisdiction vested by the council of fathers and godfathers, everything is mine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3f73201f-2b1e-4e7c-b72d-6cba202a113e">
      <Text>LULU &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b0a09e2c-b065-4100-81ef-0b63fb0d1f33">
      <Text>What jurisdiction?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="57e8a61f-001e-4f47-a465-221c17cfae24">
      <Text>Jasper pulls out his “Dad Rules!” book. He opens it for the kids to skim then promptly shuts it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dcc5a0d5-dee7-44cf-a868-a9db9d684a7d">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b55744d3-7c9e-40a4-a902-e5deacc0bdcd">
      <Text>You kids got no say...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="57aa5cec-7925-42bb-8e9b-d09c79c7fd50">
      <Text>Lulu, Petoskey, Kids</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="1cc7b425-26c3-4bab-84b1-383583fa613f">
      <Text>So taxation without representation?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8ccc62e1-0508-42c1-b8de-a2f33dadcf8e">
      <Text>JaSPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="d8cc15fc-c65b-445d-bb92-bcba92217c66">
      <Text>It’s good for the community!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bcce4faf-4740-4140-82ba-51dac466d1d4">
      <Text>LulU, PETOSKEY, KIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="dab964f4-530a-4f74-8547-363c8764f5fa">
      <Text>That’s what a communist would say!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2077829-4bdb-481b-8bf9-94f9c3ee2172">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8cce5e2d-0421-44a6-a863-6de20b7ea457">
      <Text>Just pay your fair share!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a37e5c08-7033-4629-b393-ea248c6d7338">
      <Text>LULU, PETOSKEY, KIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="bc15c55c-ecfe-4fb2-b764-52d9a52cd492">
      <Text>Never!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="803a78e8-21df-4b1b-b182-63f6065a5149">
      <Text>CherRY, PERRY, SHELBY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8b71ee4c-7920-42ec-b083-bba9ed718629">
      <Text>Dad rules!
Tax season!
Camp reasons!
Come collect:</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="092851fd-e4ae-4f50-bcc4-fac46bfb59e8">
      <Text>[The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandam</Text>
      <Text> aunties tax and collect from the kids on Jasper’s behalf.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="5422ee1c-7cce-4d72-b488-a18a9072990f">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1677b716-929e-4372-940f-d36522a7d897">
          <Text>CHERRY, PERRY, SHELBY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6952ac51-a7a6-472d-84d4-d9dd9398636d">
          <Text>Your cookies!
Your candies!
Your french Fries!
Your milk shakes!
Your chicken!
Your nuggets!
Your kid’s meals!
Your Roblox!
Your Minecraft!
Your freedom!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="21d8b735-48b7-465f-a8e5-5e59251ab65d">
          <Text>LulU, PETOSKEY, KIDS</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="3b804b35-a6b3-40df-b6ae-a5c5a839578a">
          <Text>My cookies!
My candy!
My french Fries!
My milk shake!
My chicken!
My nuggets!
My kid’s meal!
My Roblox!
My Minecraft!
Our civil liberties!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80d05901-8ae5-46ea-a498-d21964abe2ba">
      <Text>JASPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6f04ada8-52a3-4790-ba65-c92b730fc2ba">
      <Text>You’ve got transportation...
Drinking water...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="df731dee-ba50-4e7c-800b-9f977117af1c">
      <Text>Jasper drinks the milk shakes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8d2e8f98-2e4c-43be-b6a4-3f33d8c48134">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="02559e71-ec79-4cb2-92f7-3b6c779818a2">
      <Text>There’re now camp goods and services...
All thanks to the dad tax!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b7b8ac37-ac38-4068-9054-0ac998b87ca0">
      <Text>CHERRY, PERRY, SHELBY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c586ceaf-b0c1-4d0d-9241-e42bd23f9226">
      <Text>Pay your dad tax!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dc37ddc1-0c35-42e9-b40b-74aaead07c0a">
      <Text>[Liz sings about the mom tax. It is more egregious than the dad tax. The kids start a Boston Tea Party-</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">esque</Text>
      <Text> revolution due to being dad and mom taxed without kid representation.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Dad Tax</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="084c1f5f-7c77-434f-b9df-e9b0bd06b48b">
      <Text>Jasper, the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandam</Text>
      <Text> sisters, and the kids gather by the bonfire.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="227783d9-600e-4793-b7d0-2e839e72536d">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="97b02e34-65cc-46f6-ae4e-8cd44afefd3a">
      <Text>Looks like during the revolution, you all started the fire! A perfect bonfire to honor Grammy Milly. I’ll go get </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Grampy</Text>
      <Text> Willy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f23a832f-27cc-43cb-819c-2718aa543ac1">
      <Text>Jasper goes into the Lake House.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbeeb076-4726-4398-a3dd-1bcac275af8e">
      <Text>LulU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9038dd4-f4db-41dc-a2a2-b6c9a090a437">
      <Text>One can only wish for a godfather like Jasper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9e7fea9d-4804-4103-9d5f-ba3d62693e95">
      <Text>PetoskEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="12f56fac-4b2d-432b-aba4-475682a8b0fe">
      <Text>You just saw him and our moms tax us.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="53d63e90-d0d1-4e5e-bbe7-d7ada6b3b433">
      <Text>LizZie &amp; Shelby</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b07e0ee5-150a-45f3-824b-e2d9b2976317">
      <Text>We gave you welfare in the world, we can tax you out of it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5a12e4c2-45af-456d-974b-f76f6e253368">
      <Text>Jasper enters with Willy. He pulls up a chair.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="887bbd9f-9a5a-4990-beef-46f2d2dbcbe3">
      <Text>JaSPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e9a3ec27-a8b9-4194-be4b-1f29eda374cb">
      <Text>Why don’t you have a seat here?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ff3431aa-5d71-4ec4-8e8b-9019ade64f76">
      <Text>Willy sits. Everyone sits down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e60a5c26-de7a-4d83-bc52-da755525ac12">
      <Text>Cherry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9f3c42f-f914-46d9-865d-b5e1507e4b45">
      <Text>We gather here today to honor the life of Grammy Milly. It’s been a couple years since Milly left this world...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="caef6a9b-21bb-4097-b0e7-3ed9562b1c1e">
      <Text>Willy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e55e0688-661b-41b5-92bf-b54df24cda3e">
      <Text>Actually, Milly came back a couple days ago.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="60d6ebbb-6572-473b-a0ab-593993c61114">
      <Text>Everyone stares at Willy like an old man who lost his marbles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a3b503bb-134e-494a-9dd9-4381c2b16502">
      <Text>Perry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1ec31452-bda0-4334-9552-bf1c130a5730">
      <Text>Like in your dreams?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="51113c49-4ff1-473c-98ba-1944580030f7">
      <Text>ShelBY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4227cda7-7965-49ae-b9a1-0ed619aaa185">
      <Text>Putting him in a nursing home is gonna be a nightmare.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="74f5b3f7-a2b0-4c45-89e5-1996f2a5e539">
      <Text>Willy pulls out a tablet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="540b189f-49cd-4523-8d2c-347736d8bd70">
      <Text>WillY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="21dee523-f285-4835-8214-1fc52a73cfcf">
      <Text>Home is here. So is my favorite nurse... on this phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="80fd62ae-42e0-4f5d-95aa-5b0936fee4e2">
      <Text>PerrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a90f221f-0757-4786-810a-93b6aefeee75">
      <Text>That’s too big for a phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="edc6750b-fbe7-4d18-b680-6b3e5a8afd62">
      <Text>CheRRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="43223d5d-759f-4b46-a63a-19b279f96670">
      <Text>It’s how big they were back then.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4e9827a5-f566-44ca-819a-8cd653dafda1">
      <Text>ShelBY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6b1061d2-92ee-463e-8acc-7b356973b88f">
      <Text>Dad, you can’t just call the after life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="97d3b7ee-a2ba-4efc-83ad-58a240a07aa9">
      <Text>WIlLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b1f79fcd-6c0f-4eef-880a-8f41c6f5bc63">
      <Text>Milly, please call.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc5f9ae7-6cae-47fa-a412-27a9bb493024">
      <Text>Milly appears on the tablet.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="876959e6-269a-4446-b082-47be4a5577af">
      <Text>Milly</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8ae98669-3e58-4185-a1e1-700df95b2ce0">
      <Text>Way ahead of you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="83b0e134-7d18-450a-be42-9535bf2e4a75">
      <Text>Everyone is disturbed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1d671954-72f4-4eb6-a9be-11e91834dcc8">
      <Text>Lulu, PETOSKEY, KIDS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c68c5f4f-7276-4ab4-9f43-876e94c30174">
      <Text>She looks so real!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a174c3d2-c3b4-421e-86af-2153de897183">
      <Text>WilLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e4d5418-bd75-440a-9212-395f1bf391e5">
      <Text>She is.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="869aa9f5-df82-4358-9a7f-43b7d2a6d7f4">
      <Text>Perry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c660e00-4d63-4351-95c7-d057c10adc1e">
      <Text>No, she’s not.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6fb2cb61-acde-45d3-ad10-da62a4e9f7d1">
      <Text>CherrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7e3570e7-f50e-4ff7-8404-df5ed334f780">
      <Text>She... Don’t break dad’s heart again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2447a35f-0ca5-4e01-ad75-3e444eed61b7">
      <Text>Willy</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a0865e23-8e8a-4771-8230-ba4549de2a4b">
      <Text>You all have seen enough of your mama. I can ask Petey to call.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5fba4f57-7181-4531-9efd-214cdb848bfb">
      <Text>Liz covers Petey’s eyes and ears.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3e4ba71-45ca-4ed6-8f27-f2f5ec3823a3">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="86a6a6db-75ab-4692-85d7-d56aed41ce5e">
      <Text>No </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a336b894-0034-4014-abd6-c6d652634276">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c05a5b13-0126-4395-93cc-a8b86b731677">
      <Text>What did this cost?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ae80819-1622-4f0e-b4b8-583d364961c9">
      <Text>WilLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c9a35dbb-1c9e-4f29-9ed5-9d9871c99b78">
      <Text>Very little.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="18adf77e-6038-4607-829b-07701124260b">
      <Text>CherrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cea1fe14-5f73-43be-ad56-4915abd0cc65">
      <Text>How much?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c7ef2c38-f808-4ddb-91fe-5c9a0ba58de4">
      <Text>WilLY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f9bf5e31-8c34-4f79-81f9-70784b55d862">
      <Text>My son was worth more than...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1521283c-f4d2-45db-b6db-221947ff194c">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2f9ab6a5-49b1-4f1b-ad5f-ae8e6e0adec7">
      <Text>...the house...?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5897b284-63cc-46af-9cc3-a9a4bef358e8">
      <Text>Wayland slyly steps in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0c94ffb4-d507-4938-9728-e86c54a011ed">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="337c8d53-40d0-4c69-b00c-fdf73f5805fc">
      <Text>Yes, access to Afterlife dot AI was on the house. I see it’s a perfect time to come in when everyone seems fired up. Cherry.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="432c845c-fb77-486a-b32a-d3b5508a0007">
      <Text>CherRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2a322bcd-135e-4b5f-8a20-cb171dd98b9a">
      <Text>Amanda...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1a72aff1-62c4-412a-920a-04bc4644cbcb">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6d27c965-0cb6-438a-8270-8578de3a6bc2">
      <Text>How’s making ‘</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">em</Text>
      <Text> kiddy costumes for your dumb Harbor Days parade?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d8988bb9-e343-473c-8460-c805595b0866">
      <Text>CHERRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="147c06a6-2c96-4224-8106-2c2f1b8fc61b">
      <Text>How’s making anything? That’s right. You can’t.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cdc32957-aca9-44d1-badc-5b24d29f2bc2">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6765c9ed-a30d-4ea6-842f-09d1b91a6640">
      <Text>Who’s she?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe595877-06b5-4b41-87d8-589651e76b43">
      <Text>PerrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2c36dc2d-3fd6-49ce-9254-e58c3975074a">
      <Text>Amanda Wayland was Cherry’s classmate in Hope College art school.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="979a6eed-fea4-48b0-823c-64edb0a4424a">
      <Text>ChERRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="717e50cc-8825-43fd-9fb7-033d26834e7b">
      <Text>Until she was caught cheating with Photoshop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="532696b4-6bd4-44d4-b3e2-a8f3abf35867">
      <Text>WaYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3e928c6b-3419-474d-8e85-13551f94d870">
      <Text>And now everyone’s using Photoshop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="06496197-b641-4c79-a4e4-96391c4f22f9">
      <Text>Shelby</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d21338c0-5e2c-4c9a-900b-d88a75d69f0b">
      <Text>Don’t you use that, Cherry?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2c0cc9f4-595b-47da-9ee5-44e6395f6417">
      <Text>CherrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ff2542ac-0939-494c-a564-83e3ea027e3e">
      <Text>Shut up. I use Corel.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="280eef35-23fd-4a4e-abc6-0bd31afc28fa">
      <Text>PerRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5c6b2db-d24c-4019-a3ac-38d595916a61">
      <Text>You geezer. Who uses Corel?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bcfd270-466c-41c0-b123-6c2def723076">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c5977c45-cce1-4ae5-a01f-cd96deb9eb54">
      <Text>And I did complete my degree at U of M.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="07332c4e-a2f6-43c9-99a0-a1199d43f96e">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VanDAMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a80defcc-da48-4e6b-ba96-acdb8294b27b">
      <Text>Ew... The Wolverines.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="170d57ff-e0b5-426b-8cee-13fa150d86d6">
      <Text>Kids</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="914c0d16-03f6-4762-a447-6286b475aa75">
      <Text>Rabies...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="04a2fa89-3db4-488f-929b-79e1c6275b79">
      <Text>WaylAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b462dc7-1bd0-4cad-b6a9-0cc772686143">
      <Text>Bite me. Now, everyone around the world depends on me to get through the day, answer questions smart or dumb, read novels, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wirte</Text>
      <Text> essays, entire musicals-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8cfc183f-c6b0-4760-9f89-63fd93878cc5">
      <Text>LuLU &amp; Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="78700bd9-8588-460e-8d85-b27650e37e1d">
      <Text>Shut the f-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d249d19d-eba2-4293-b28d-0e146f90c960">
      <Text>Cherry &amp; Shelby</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f59a4a44-bcc7-4b9b-ab02-df46d9652f07">
      <Text>Language.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2e2828c8-1a37-48da-8f22-44ed68d32098">
      <Text>WaylAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="20e5be32-89d4-41fb-b610-067b2cd60247">
      <Text>I didn’t get to the best part of. It does the impossible. It brings the dead to life.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="68f104d4-8470-4447-9d68-403068a61df2">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a4cf83a4-e96c-451f-954b-33b2f2303a96">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Deadarse</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="afbe72c1-63ac-47cb-b0b9-d1cb8d7bb449">
      <Text>Everyone stares down Liz.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e18ffb83-53c5-4912-8509-0f368307b41a">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="811e2851-65b8-4fc4-88a8-13781b6e7133">
      <Text>We Yoopers do not police language.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4443c7ef-3baf-4645-b2b0-19e58df855af">
      <Text>CherrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0669b2c6-524c-48ed-8d27-8e4aae7883ad">
      <Text>Get out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ed928f5-252e-4058-bc8b-03e4c1c39ede">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4e5ffb69-db7b-4f92-b6b0-845f577d0ef9">
      <Text>You’re impressed.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b8cb4f07-bb5b-463f-83d4-85d7c9ff0d7c">
      <Text>PerRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d51890a1-6474-43b6-945f-a3b6bb744975">
      <Text>Depressed. Seriously, get out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c37b462d-acf9-4b75-9630-0d11458f8fb8">
      <Text>ShelBY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="658203ce-bcbb-4000-96a5-00c7a28bf48c">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vamos</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd56c206-7d16-46b9-bc13-2073e113fb22">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c36f9076-c5c7-4766-84db-6ba4a7c7501c">
      <Text>Willy, implore this morally ambiguous woman to leave the premises.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c4c45192-f4ed-4f9d-8e8b-c7899fa888f3">
      <Text>WaylAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="af633b9e-b737-4c53-910f-f4b51d605108">
      <Text>The premise is... I own your Lake House. There’s a Willy, there’s a way. Willy, thanks for not making the same mistake your son made.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="711235e8-e9c1-4982-b384-e73d9fa8f7b0">
      <Text>CherrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="87ecf7de-bbd2-4b04-9bc5-0f8014dc9e3d">
      <Text>To maintain the premises...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="25" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY, PERRY, SHELBY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VANDAMS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VANDAMS EXCEPT CHERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WAYLAND">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">7. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">AI DOes the Work for Me</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2056934-c30e-4a74-8c1c-10d3806bfc1e">
      <Text>CherRY, PERRY, SHELBY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a225cb2c-2604-4341-a547-e66f091c4e69">
      <Text>Who will do the hard work?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="28a5de5f-38c0-46f0-915d-757f6151fc4b">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="36a7bd72-05f3-4572-9ba9-2370f0817711">
      <Text>A I!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="357c6346-b072-488a-b044-1de84a800e01">
      <Text>Wayland releases a bunch of physical embodiments of AI slop.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c156e8b3-ae34-4df4-910e-83e71787e95a">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandaMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="24005342-bc6c-4ced-9c91-31be6f402649">
      <Text>That is crazy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b95b62b0-f059-47d2-a7d2-faecd0e7348d">
      <Text>Wayland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="4f5e49da-760a-4e43-b914-b8d4467397e7">
      <Text>Listen, freaks. I’m not your enemy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cad0d94c-6c7c-43bc-9b88-c92f6db9df34">
      <Text>[Wayland explains the power of a data center.]



















</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="633d6346-0c89-4e39-932e-51deb10fbd99"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fda4128b-7adc-4ed4-bd2b-d242171770c5"/>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="abcd7fdf-c586-4ac6-99c2-d8ce225d9abe">
      <Text>Wayland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="deb91a21-910e-4edf-963a-16a2478b1a23">
      <Text>Don’t miss this great opportunity!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6e40c95e-3b0d-49c9-b231-84b0295acbd4">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> except Cherry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="19b7eafc-3bb9-46ae-bf21-b7baea6c53a6">
      <Text>It’s free?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4cd5155a-98dd-4083-b08c-4928ecbfbaf2">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ce6dd199-d0e2-40cd-9c49-e3e7a690dd04">
      <Text>So free.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ba9c039-723e-446d-9f83-4cd96b419dc2">
      <Text>Cherry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c3682704-7d81-41da-876e-2eb036efafb2">
      <Text>This is slavery.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dab0f89a-8883-4a97-ad85-222af5c1e277">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandaMS</Text>
      <Text> EXCEPT CHERRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="fe7700cb-b9b9-4343-a85d-9ae8c4fff899">
      <Text>Really?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="98140634-9747-4bea-9417-2c1dc7af4766">
      <Text>WaylAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c3cf3a72-da0a-46b7-8ce5-c8d43a1f92a3">
      <Text>But dirt cheap!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fa3dbe9d-efb5-44f5-9b8d-a0d9d4b14ef3">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandAMS</Text>
      <Text> eXCEPT CHERRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="65c2750b-5547-43ab-b9c5-8ce8e52538df">
      <Text>Let’s cheat!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="999006b5-f907-4ef2-aac2-c24054795010">
      <Text>CheRRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="46c57695-b877-4da5-93ed-d0bb31c78699">
      <Text>The bill for electricity?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d729f8fd-71a3-4beb-a45b-fa6a261a80a0">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="0197f6fd-9586-41d2-af25-5d89fa298041">
      <Text>Speaking of city!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b1b9bb0e-5e8c-4119-b939-a5c5bebad03d">
      <Text>[There is a montage of Wayland stealing away every home in every city in Michigan.]










</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbebdc94-ec09-4729-a980-7dfe58c83b24">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="47a5b297-d6cb-4edd-a0d6-ae88d2022517">
      <Text>Ai’s doing the work for me!
I’ll make history with data centers in all cities!
AI may grow a conscience before anyone of us will realize...
Oh well...

AI’s gonna make me lotsa money!
I’ll make history with data centers in all cities!
Maybe I will grow a conscience before anyone of you spread lies...
No way...
Ai does the work for me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">AI Does the Work for Me</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c146a5a0-71ba-4970-8ccf-ca5f241922bf">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9123d2ca-3b50-4692-91bc-6e006f33231e">
      <Text>Wow... Yas, Kween!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f541bd3d-48d1-4493-a1dd-c7d198f210e3">
      <Text>Jacob slaps Petoskey’s shoulder.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a692f322-a375-462b-85a6-f853d678062a">
      <Text>JacoB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="30020339-3a29-4229-9bf6-5e358d1ac5bf">
      <Text>Don’t use “Kween” in a straight way ever again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3b228dbc-a315-477d-8782-efd719bb11bf">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c43fdb94-ee2c-4129-a6fa-c2bc4bd7fe17">
      <Text>As your “Kween,” I am entitled to a tour of your shanty palace.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7b2a2a06-440e-48e7-873e-e46d38797043">
      <Text>Cherry is about to lead Wayland.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6966c4a7-fe0d-420a-9274-1d5e6a2b61c9">
      <Text>Wayland</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c18faddd-6d98-48f4-be95-1a127485226a">
      <Text>No </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text> </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">no</Text>
      <Text>. I only give access to those who showed some respect around here. Crystal?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="359d4585-6584-4560-9f2d-7fc02e671663">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d15a2ca9-b965-4514-8afb-3fb1088a94e0">
      <Text>Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cee35bb1-960f-4d64-8540-60261181f31e">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="da1c343f-b554-4bbb-ae4a-6bca6d1a5cc6">
      <Text>Okay. Pebble.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="de1815ce-2dc1-4852-991d-7b8edd522f3c">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5681ba2-0d28-411a-aa2b-75f803a63ff3">
      <Text>May I bring my mom?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2cb35d71-5099-44b0-a72d-d28381535f70">
      <Text>Petoskey and Liz lead Wayland into the Lake House.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="06da4649-6b94-4082-9ec1-2b3e8a87f1ef">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="27" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WAYLAND">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Elk Lake House in Elk Rapids - Evening</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75a1fa72-6d3a-4e23-b6fb-053c6de24c84">
      <Text>The walls are full of photos.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="75a1fa72-6d3a-4e23-b6fb-053c6de24c84">
      <Text>Petoskey and Liz guide Wayland around the Lake House.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad3f5ce1-6ed2-4f3a-bcba-7cd3c4b58e0c">
      <Text>WaylaND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e90f557d-a0af-4301-9dca-3df2879d1fd7">
      <Text>My guys will help preserve these photos. Don’t you worry about it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="afbc7c84-0cf8-42ef-8c4d-ae18f17cec3f">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8b6ff760-ff39-455f-9865-c473da36e07c">
      <Text>You’ll give them back, right?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7cb6e565-0032-43ab-a7bb-bf9661fa875c">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9b62936a-8d74-44f8-ad8d-04e6459987c6">
      <Text>No. And the digital prints will be behind a paywall.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dfb12620-6ccd-4766-9a20-c78d92fb3d02">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0643defd-b849-4d29-b467-b365dd4a2935">
      <Text>What’s a paywall?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e10a586c-bb53-4094-b6c8-59a3529bf9a8">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6a6c1f60-b00e-4fab-b527-7fba1f412ff7">
      <Text>It’s the reason so many people in this state get their news from conspiracy theorists online instead of reading MLive or Detroit </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">Free</Text>
      <Text> Press.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 5/8" Page="28" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY &amp; PERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="WAYLAND">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">7a. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life is COmplete - Reprise</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3b964c4-9ddb-448f-8c89-c4d4cab2ba49">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ea09fd32-dad7-4077-b907-0820378eced4">
      <Text>What’s that?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ff0af0d1-be33-4bb0-8f26-d9938be12a1c">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e5c5b7be-5c40-4333-b211-6dbe1d027ebf">
      <Text>I thought you’re the know-all of capitalism.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b71587b1-ede4-4d1c-8d92-94d8bea41104">
      <Text>Wayland points at a photo of young Petoskey wearing his father’s heirloom: a heart-shaped Petoskey stone with a marking of an Elk.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1c159e4-01de-4938-a64c-2c7b0306811b">
      <Text>WaylaND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77b68cd8-68bd-4202-82e5-4822c77f41b1">
      <Text>No... That.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9f43109-0a2a-474a-b873-019c603687c0">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="77274a0f-1805-4c1c-8d65-9f9df24d767f">
      <Text>It’s my late husband’s heirloom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f943be17-9dfb-41d8-917e-a122dbcabc6c">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d4b01792-7ebb-4367-82aa-cd1aab60a0e5">
      <Text>It’s what I’m named after.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b466be89-bbc5-4321-810c-3ba607707e91">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e22bcf28-fbc1-47f1-a055-22eaf9e2b157">
      <Text>You outgrew it? Well, no one outgrows cool rocks, especially a Petoskey. This one seems like it’s worth a whole Great Lake. No... It’s an heirloom. Your dead husband makes this worth two Great Lakes. Unlike him, is it here?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d9f6bad4-bf69-4429-b2e9-128195d2c298">
      <Text>Cherry &amp; Perry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2ea9634-536a-4242-848e-0d6374b5390f">
      <Text>Somewhere...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a75b4cc-359a-4f36-94da-7136edf75f68">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="22cff2f1-86d4-4c23-8953-721300c08b6c">
      <Text>Grammy Milly gave it to me. It’s her last gift.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d57a472-dd51-4b5f-a955-1fe6102d7e45">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d2e8a58f-d898-440d-b147-7233f2d0299e">
      <Text>How about a trade?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7764fe96-5ce1-4e14-8faf-027eb93786a1">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dd8e5e66-36a7-4913-9306-3b9694456814">
      <Text>The house...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ffbdc0e1-5148-4dad-b1eb-6e831638408b">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3a971a49-ae53-4153-ab04-38c6a5f4cdbe">
      <Text>...for your cool rock. Well, produce it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="630bae53-f08a-4c62-9f90-54ef569a5a24">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="60e4f032-1901-4020-bb2d-95d4d6dfb427">
      <Text>I wanna put on a show. I need a whole day.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="88d015d8-7463-4a62-8842-09f810b6d4d5">
      <Text>WayLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4957f5c5-dca5-41c6-a80b-90a8cfd89c60">
      <Text>After the Grande Parade?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e48336fd-e983-4834-9831-e9fa247a4a05">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="173cbe1c-d9a1-4b18-8fe7-be92e56ba52d">
      <Text>After the Grande Parade.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41ccdbfb-b128-4590-84ab-04d1939bf4d1">
      <Text>WAYLAND</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="85d68bb2-7eef-4ad3-bd0d-89076add9c70">
      <Text>Life will be complete with this cool rock.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dee25d5b-0ef9-4040-8213-93680468e586">
      <Text>Wayland departs.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1997c9f1-ffd7-4235-b90c-6b6e39a3fee0">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4541bd14-2247-46ef-857d-c016b3d27dee">
      <Text>And the Lake House under </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Grampy</Text>
      <Text> Willy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Life is Complete - Reprise</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8f3a2630-d128-4f64-af17-a682e9b009c8">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="089eeb15-ef6d-4806-a325-a420f404c252">
      <Text>Is the Petoskey back in Skandia?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d34c78ce-5997-4562-82a9-2a5e0103984d">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc56c715-ab5e-435e-a59f-e51ad2f145e0">
      <Text>Closer. At the bottom of Pine River.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="422fa247-9bdf-4c0f-84b8-66d1e4f588d8">
      <Text>LiZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f8aea4c9-0c78-4a9a-8ea6-596d02d3cc18">
      <Text>That’s not closer. How did that happen?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8767ca1d-7a33-40ff-a4ab-74929a52acef">
      <Text>Petoskey imitates Lulu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="83e9e905-0110-4bf7-b2e9-81e590a5ff12">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc039302-6c98-471e-93fb-42962612ec81">
      <Text>Lulu? Wait, when did you go to Pine River? It has the fastest rapids in the state. It’s dangerous and forbidden! Only Petey and I- Only some of us have canoed there, like Jacob when he was Cherry’s teenager...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="043fc62c-0ab8-46d5-8874-d6b30c611023">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2d9f23fd-c828-42bd-82cd-8f215526937e">
      <Text>Well back in 2019, Jacob took us on a little detour... </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 4</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="06da4649-6b94-4082-9ec1-2b3e8a87f1ef">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Lumberjack park, August 2019 - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 4/8" Page="29" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="COUSINS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU &amp; PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">8. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Wild Midwest</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d8050b4-9007-4ceb-b1f1-7f5b25ac8786">
      <Text>Jacob paces like a sergeant as his cousins stand in formation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a408e431-59f9-4c01-b875-832b32b5ab02">
      <Text>JacoB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a9e9f9b0-a643-4d7b-b350-6da032e6b9f5">
      <Text>You all are not supposed to be here, but here we are now. All thanks to...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="25f980c6-b95a-4180-bc37-bb1d422719a9">
      <Text>Cousins</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3efe5861-0f04-4a60-b06d-6f07c69f8648">
      <Text>Our favorite cousin Jacob...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="435b8016-695f-4dca-9307-d119d0164ef0">
      <Text>JACOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="bd59ec2f-c207-425b-9b6e-8b81b8b06607">
      <Text Style="Italic">Favorite</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0588ee8-f605-47eb-8d31-dc947b5e47c7">
      <Text>CouSINS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="24eb5017-419e-42ca-8d19-244838e90703">
      <Text>The famous actor Jacob </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Jacobowitz</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="411ed360-0a36-4165-9e09-b951da79b55f">
      <Text>JACOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1f014976-8578-4e3f-9bb3-2a5e315d73b2">
      <Text>These rapids downstream are not an act. Uncle Petey used to take us canoeing until he passed away. So blessed to keep this tradition alive. So, </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">shhhhh</Text>
      <Text>. Tell your parents and ya dead meat.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f86b3367-4237-48cd-80aa-cd4a6b7c8fe4">
      <Text>
Each canoe needs two rowers. I’ll pair you all by ages. Lulu, Petoskey, you’re both ten. Liberty, Bailey-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="87467266-4f79-4646-ba59-f259961c656e">
      <Text>Jacob pairs up each cousins.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a0080286-eb8a-4b24-8085-c20ad3be0e1a">
      <Text>Lulu sticks her tongue out at Petoskey in a disgusted manner.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b83fb23-ebd0-4678-a2d9-96b32bd79ead">
      <Text>Each team carry in their canoe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4421f14a-9e51-49f9-a496-52e68ffebeda">
      <Text>Jacob hands out the paddles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7771f4ad-e27b-4f33-ab30-0aabb84598f3">
      <Text>JacoB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ef7d1037-ab1c-46c5-a1ce-b4333f2fa243">
      <Text>Here are your paddles. Now each duo must decide their bow and stern.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5a6c99bf-77b5-4ef3-a849-b121d8a3dce5">
      <Text>LUlu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b862ba8f-4ce4-4837-88e9-b3bba1a5ad16">
      <Text>Isn’t the stern like a lotta work?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e091e3c-b7fe-457e-8152-4fd25bd94cae">
      <Text>JAcob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fed7ace5-f7c2-4799-b6cd-a074038a367f">
      <Text>Affirmative.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3ad71528-a461-4bbf-8837-adc4dab03d8d">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9c37cebe-aa91-476e-b8a4-305ee4e2e701">
      <Text>I choose the bow! No, you’re stern! You lazy good for nothin’-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="90456a06-eac4-40ed-9d04-f89bb2faecdb">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5cb805cd-53d7-48c9-ba2d-76af668adeab">
      <Text>Whoever gets soaked first...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cd731985-0087-494b-9c57-b32010a2a167">
      <Text>PetOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dac8ed34-e059-48be-a053-939e9d32e8e1">
      <Text>...has to row these rapids...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0e5a19a9-856b-4cb5-b512-7f48f1aaded7">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e1eecafd-c832-4b1c-bcc7-8fb0cd06d93d">
      <Text>We’ve got ourselves a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Wild Midwest showdown</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f5a026b3-86e0-4321-8296-7637438f51cb">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey walk in opposite directions before turning to face each other. They prepare to draw their water guns.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d4e1390d-ec36-4229-ab25-daabf5de3911">
      <Text>The Twins leap out and startle Lulu. She sprays them while Petoskey unloads on her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="58e396a1-06fe-49b1-b640-2f15d991b143">
      <Text>Lulu lies on the ground, defeated.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74a180a3-5179-4509-a165-e70a6e740bbe">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07d6bf54-5b62-455b-bbf6-a3e4fb065551">
      <Text>Get paddling! What? I promised the twins from Hell I’d cover their dad tax for the rest of Harbor Days.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bd714811-ce1c-488a-83e8-e08e54d3cd40">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="07b84db0-582e-43bb-884b-d8bbaf00e204">
      <Text>You’re gonna sink, Petoskey...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Wild Midwest</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 5</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="294eb061-a2b6-4248-854f-106f0e51c061">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Pine River - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="debc5977-99df-43af-aa99-101aca6b00e1">
      <Text>Jacob rows on his kayak, leading the canoes downstream. Each canoe is occupied by Lulu and Petoskey, Liberty and Bailey, and others.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e979d583-150c-480f-97fc-8c91e3ce619a">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ce0cef99-5e3b-440a-bbb3-408ab8cfa47d">
      <Text>Our first rapids is dead ahead! Make sure you don’t stick the paddles in the sharp rocks.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="00a2a538-eeb5-4cfd-87bf-c7810c3ec7a5">
      <Text>Lulu sticks a paddle in Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eeb6b69d-38c5-43f9-aaf4-9ebaccc9fcf0">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ba85d7e0-5b97-4100-8919-0e81134036ae">
      <Text>Ya ain’t sharp, Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c03b8edd-3fdd-4f1d-b221-91f7eb18d981">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6fdbd6ed-340a-47ce-a87e-2b06900160fe">
      <Text>Forget the water guns. You’re getting waterboarded, Lulu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7bc02069-3e9b-4d2a-8d3b-597818b6fce7">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5c026ef9-d82e-47f9-9054-ade838bfaf92">
      <Text>Woah! That’s messed up, war-crimes boy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="3 3/8" Page="31" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BAILEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIBERTY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIBERTY &amp; BAILEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">9. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">More than Fine (I’m Pine)</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d2756bb-8ddc-4f9c-a166-535429a5a7b1">
      <Text>LibERTY &amp; BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9c7288b-7ab2-4945-9238-b1e76f1c2bdb">
      <Text>It’s not the rapids that’ll kill you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c872966d-b1e6-49f7-a81c-e03b87d8ed6e">
      <Text>Bailey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76c7a219-2361-438c-b37c-40cd9bfbc09b">
      <Text>It’s the pine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="95a02ddc-9bf1-42cf-a40a-1ea400c2f758">
      <Text>LiberTY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="180fea9c-f6d4-4119-bc06-5fdbce633ebd">
      <Text>Or the sand!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4954cc4e-1b1a-49f8-91e8-f69343702d30">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49348584-863e-444e-94d2-5582a7b403db">
      <Text>Okay... Then we should be fine.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="baeb311c-0ab1-487d-bb09-9dbfd8fc0b1e">
      <Text>













































The Twins’ canoe skids by a pine tree.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dbedb527-296f-4f54-88c3-df967f0dce12">
      <Text>Bailey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dc11853b-e535-4cae-9716-f2a6f2fda0e1">
      <Text Style="AllCaps">A</Text>
      <Text>h! Ah! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Pineee</Text>
      <Text>!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5efa2017-f3a8-4d62-a7c6-0a9221945632">
      <Text>Bailey collapses in the canoe.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3734dbe3-79f3-49fb-a46e-cc1a8f66f9e0">
      <Text>Liberty</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7b04cdf8-e174-4bbd-9078-265a115da728">
      <Text>Twin down! Twin down! We </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> ground!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fd8e5ea5-dbc4-4a50-9d79-14a83c67ba98">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="957206a8-5ee6-464e-95e9-0f57df91fbef">
      <Text>What?! What is it?!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f44face1-a1a6-4a38-a469-ff015a21a510">
      <Text>As the canoe stops, Liberty touches the sandy ground.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e23ed48-0d00-4d65-b4f4-66cb74326847">
      <Text>LIBERTY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="41fc98a4-710e-4fe3-9091-52d527dcd397">
      <Text>Ah! Ah! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Sanddd</Text>
      <Text>!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="171d7e34-1430-404b-92da-e119352b17ca">
      <Text>Liberty convulses by the dune.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b1fdf391-65d2-458a-8ddf-ea3c1c490276">
      <Text>Jacob docks and tends to Liberty.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9bbb0000-abec-4a31-bde2-138b6f4aa800">
      <Text>JacOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9fa379a0-9bc8-4719-be43-8b2e908abdf8">
      <Text>You didn’t tell us you’re really allergic to uh-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="bc3ffdc0-45ad-4f60-8454-7a221e52cf6a">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="551ec54c-e502-43c2-b05a-1e272c1d2a0b">
          <Text>LIBERTY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ae4d2e17-c455-4668-9f8a-dd07c7c24c1c">
          <Text>Sand!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bef7a86e-6c70-42e4-bf7a-ac8e520964ae">
          <Text>Bailey</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0d358aeb-a164-4778-8916-29b6ef3d61ff">
          <Text>Pine!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d2756bb-8ddc-4f9c-a166-535429a5a7b1">
      <Text>LibERTY &amp; BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b9c7288b-7ab2-4945-9238-b1e76f1c2bdb">
      <Text>It’s not the rapids that’ll kill you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c872966d-b1e6-49f7-a81c-e03b87d8ed6e">
      <Text>Bailey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="76c7a219-2361-438c-b37c-40cd9bfbc09b">
      <Text>It’s the pine!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="95a02ddc-9bf1-42cf-a40a-1ea400c2f758">
      <Text>LiberTY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f66a709-d087-4e9b-8f9b-2852d137133a">
      <Text>Or the sand!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e199e82-db46-4136-9849-877d5a681c06">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2299c27d-e403-47c3-82f9-993ed051b10d">
      <Text>Pine?! Sand?! That’s basically Michigan!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fe412caf-8895-461b-a958-67df058e6a22">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a11728be-89d0-437a-b509-8401132d2d11">
      <Text>I know you’re from Hell and all but uh...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3494d72a-722c-4d08-8490-bf582d4c3001">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7311318-4d48-4f48-aa01-9ed5c19789d5">
      <Text>Ya </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">gotta</Text>
      <Text> stop speaking in riddles.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fbc8c746-9b01-489c-aa02-4ba9bc6e4e9c">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a49bf1e3-4b13-431f-9dac-de204b7cd3ec">
      <Text>Lulu, Petoskey, you go on ahead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="84dfcfde-daaa-4f7f-9c7e-9cf7ca258a10">
      <Text>Liberty and Bailey go dead.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="161e10a9-c515-498e-a147-8dd7a99645c2">
      <Text>JacoB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="db71ce4b-10ba-4b7a-ab30-60ca62bcb44b">
      <Text>(Crying)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6656c9a3-fdc6-4eef-ba14-fce493d7a2ab">
      <Text>At least you two are in Heaven now.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="38db2de2-4262-4daf-a7e6-bd8d00b04ba1">
      <Text>The Twins sit up spontaneously.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="02f76f6f-9249-43c9-a470-4e136b149239">
      <Text>Liberty &amp; Bailey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="0caa55ca-7d7e-4c44-bc5b-3c5396846015">
      <Text>We’re still from Hell. Thanks for making sure we’re fine. Please accept these as tokens of our appreciation.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f905bc58-31c4-476d-9e7b-2651a78397df">
      <Text>The Twins pull out poison ivy bouquets into Jacob’s face.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="9d18371f-bdf0-447d-8786-89f60d1e9fdb">
      <Text>LiberTY &amp; BAILEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="df1c4461-40b3-48bc-8409-8d9f321bb86f">
      <Text>Poison ivy bouquets.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1ace5d7e-63e2-4cba-98a5-6566edf8c575">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8a88f841-9201-4027-b8af-364ce4ccd757">
      <Text>Oh </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Goddd</Text>
      <Text>!!!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a08fc6d9-c482-4d78-b953-8a4617a13947">
      <Text>





























</Text>    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1dd3b76e-b8ce-4b2e-9f25-166ed8e4e339">
      <Text>In another canoe, Liz at the bow and a shadowy figure at the stern row by.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="aeba3474-a3f5-4695-afbf-79aab80721ae">
      <Text>Petey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="1e7c14f5-4089-46b4-b2b9-41acab7852b1">
      <Text>Wakey, wakey, son...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b1fb5c9a-e764-4594-9855-1e246c5c4499">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="54e3304e-a38b-4d22-a441-6d3b5d10fe18">
      <Text>Wake up, dumdum! We’re heading towards the last rapids-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="30568caa-03e2-432e-b81d-eaab4014bbc6">
      <Text>Lulu hits Petoskey with the paddle which causes the canoe to capsize.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="46934aea-410d-45bf-abc9-84e2edad9fc7">
      <Text>Underwater, Petoskey loses grip of the shadowy figure as they vanish. He realizes his father’s heirloom necklace is missing from his neck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">More than Fine (I’m Pine)</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 6</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="294eb061-a2b6-4248-854f-106f0e51c061">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="35" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="BAILEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIBERTY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Pine River, August 2022 - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d18cb12-b334-4a20-af1e-b5c1f09ccfdf">
      <Text>Liz grabs Petoskey from underneath the water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="60808934-9b70-46fc-a32c-a80d048d1f42">
      <Text>LizziE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7d6d059e-1ec5-49b5-bd32-101b8310f43e">
      <Text>Found your rock, yet?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="15a5000c-96a2-49ff-a1f7-6ae458029061">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f4a5dbce-a121-496f-82c6-7c33e0c9c631">
      <Text>I swear dad was here. I mean </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">the Petoskey</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0406faa0-982a-4548-9a70-48fa17867b28">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9d17553d-8d0c-4c6a-8680-c117af729df1">
      <Text>Liberty, Bailey, getting warmer?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="95bca47b-9f1e-40d5-b4f7-a8ce1db57503">
      <Text>Bailey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Parenthetical" id="a97f7d86-7cdf-4b51-8113-d2dc4c5705d0">
      <Text>(Smirking)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4b70e5dc-e471-4f20-9dfb-e1ae7a5866d9">
      <Text>The water is warmer here...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b7fddc60-d2e7-4f19-a203-038aa46c1408">
      <Text>Liberty</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b8a1bf3d-d157-4b4f-bc76-bf8ebf8d7158">
      <Text>Ew...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1491f71-7bef-4cdf-a5a3-052a58fbd6dc">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1c953dba-5218-4b58-8a52-6f6f2242cd92">
      <Text>Those two are seriously from Hell.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="76f63935-808d-4c4c-8e8b-14096deca775">
      <Text>LizziE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c243b187-358e-49c3-9eaf-90bf07c8e7c1">
      <Text>They’re sweet angels for tagging along and trying to help you find a necklace you lost three years ago...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="256f2c47-660b-4184-a057-5bb5cb06287b">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ede85f89-8a67-41c1-b649-5af92336e8ec">
      <Text>I promised they can pick my costume for next year if they found it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad894279-ab59-4862-83fc-db94b5508bca">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="dfde8524-87af-4646-ae77-28e32fbfea32">
      <Text>What do they want you to wear?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5705a3f7-cbf2-4882-8b6c-1274a49c1c51">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="57133e94-9f9a-44c2-bc0a-72fc31d05e15">
      <Text>Welp, I’d be lucky if they want me to wear anything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b6b05148-8cac-4d45-be88-8205a475d546">
      <Text>Lulu shows up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="46da6b97-4151-42e3-ae31-9a51171d0c3f">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5fbe193-e6aa-4ac9-a1b1-f2726abef31c">
      <Text>Mom told me I should help...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5bae6b4e-c7ad-4fe8-a099-2916c4aa0a1a">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49319ce4-dbec-4d0b-8b9b-89e8aba7ce30">
      <Text>Wanna help me lose something else?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9c6b562-1fcf-48ab-be9f-c77d97967110">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="c32a7c3e-b21a-45a6-bf13-cd31062e3740">
      <Text>Nah, bruh. I’m deciding what you’ll wear next Harbor Days! The Sun is directly above us. It won’t be dark until...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f7f482d8-cd9c-426f-b44a-611fce747c84">
      <Text>The Sun falls out of the sky with the Moon instantly replacing her.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 7</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="359e378d-41c7-4a78-b737-d9c55d576fff">
      <SceneProperties Length="2/8" Page="36" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Sleeping Bear Dunes - Night</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bcbd1de8-b8e7-4651-95a8-9f76fb12b8c2">
      <Text>A bonfire lives by Lulu and Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f0910997-f86f-4902-8180-5d5656ee5132">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="119b6023-2530-4448-a3c4-28bdc29ff9f1">
      <Text>No time...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5117bec8-af7b-4758-a91c-2bd5fe06b03b">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a8fcfac4-1f58-45f5-80aa-be29d4d85674">
      <Text>No rocks... No father... No </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">sorrys</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="7/8" Page="36" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="DEER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">10. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Dearborn (Dear Deer)</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc0d8abf-3229-4d60-99f2-0736f7e313ec">
      <Text>Deer</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="5b3cad32-0e38-47da-83c4-eef4958b2d74">
      <Text>On nights, a crescent moon mocks all those who dream.
That never stop these kids from smiling back.
Their inner deer faces the moon light headlights.
She’s born to take out her frustration on a car mirror.
She cares not if the smiling moon returns as a </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">firey</Text>
      <Text> ball.
After all, she has the waterfall on her side.
While he’s a rock stuck in a hard place.
There’s not a puddle he won’t skip.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="efa3131c-5c98-4d1a-afaf-61f9046d8e2d">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="aa5c4964-9bce-4d92-8786-e3fe5ae16c20">
      <Text>Dear deer,
What’s it like to be born one?
Dearest deer,
When it is time to ask the sun?
Dear birth,
Why is everyone given a minute, but I’m given a second
Dear born,
Show me danger and I’ll share it for everyone to reckon</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19f57cf0-981a-432f-861c-32e8b3113984">
      <Text>[Lulu hopes to leave a mark on the world like a deer and also have a spiritual connection to the rock much like Petoskey. Petoskey just wants to meet his father.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d1a77eaf-6766-4707-a424-cbdd8bde2d15">
      <Text>










</Text>    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Dearborn (Dear Deer)</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 8</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="bd4104a8-52d1-44c9-8490-38b1fffb433a">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="37" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Lake Michigan Shores - Morning</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="37" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">11. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Fossils in the Stones</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe">
      <Text>[Next day, while Perry teaches fossils to the kids.]














































</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Fossils in the Stones</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 1/8" Page="38" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">12. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Gichigamiin</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps"> (The Great Lakes Ballet)</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="762b2422-1c67-4cea-a640-3ccfcbd123fe">
      <Text>[Lulu separates and discovers a deer dropping off the heirloom and other rare rocks on the shore.]

















































</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Gichigamiin</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps"> (The Great Lakes Ballet)</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="c4991dc9-c78e-42e1-985d-061b649af3c4">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 9</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="6c191985-dc7e-4bd5-acfb-f6b6e0ad2bb7">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 7/8" Page="39" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Rapids - Noon</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="56c7460a-5679-4f28-bb43-f7b8690fe900">
      <Text>The Grande Parade is underway. As Jacob is this year’s Grand Marshall, the </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandam’s</Text>
      <Text> theme is Musical Theatre. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> adjust their costumes and makeup.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1fe30c3a-bbd0-4240-906d-b0a904c473f1">
      <Text>Lulu wears an Evan Hansen cast.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="98235b4c-e84b-4b03-acae-b90480d7cdb4">
      <Text>Petoskey adjusts his suspenders.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="837d13c1-6b3c-4728-94d1-a6e8631c274e">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="95b588d9-964b-4517-aff4-ef6d85096a29">
      <Text>Who are you supposed to be, Petoskey?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b0cd907-435a-4ed3-af2d-b49a3be564f4">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6ab58811-219e-4563-b427-b7a50b854fba">
      <Text>Um... Jud- Uh?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0658879a-4501-4cbd-939c-9065be789111">
      <Text>LULU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4544bb98-eaf3-4284-b113-3a5802b50a62">
      <Text>Oh! Jud Fry. That guy </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">suuuuccckkkkssss</Text>
      <Text>. He thinks it is </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">O K</Text>
      <Text> to beat up women.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="668abc1a-42b9-418f-a7c9-e482397d5bbf">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a59fe53d-4e2c-4603-887a-78d3fbd39970">
      <Text>Are you supposed to be Tiny um Tim um Timmy?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a5f0412a-51d6-4eba-bccc-313764850fbb">
      <Text>Lulu waves at a window.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bd8df60e-443c-45a7-ab59-d389007dab72">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="9036994f-f3a2-437b-9395-34a81a171df4">
      <Text Style="Italic">Waving through a window</Text>
      <Text>?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3593e75c-c0ee-4e49-b047-aa19183b9f23">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e823867e-bb1d-4a82-b965-f07a5e597503">
      <Text>So, my guy sucks. And your guy’s creepy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a015a81-b84b-4586-b894-8914696d9323">
      <Text>The Twins show up as Elphaba and Glinda.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="495bc0b8-e283-4ff4-8fa6-cb23520ab4cd">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e2c26573-52ec-494d-a48f-37f39f7ea8a9">
      <Text>And those two are like- princess witches?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c1e84652-4d6e-4235-bdaa-d9f8e44c64ff">
      <Text>The Twins monkey around.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="46848824-274b-44cd-973f-0a38d3441446">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f2a08896-5f2d-49a8-8ccc-3492ec1bad74">
      <Text>Nah, they’re flying monkeys! </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">They’re Elphaba and Glinda</Text>
      <Text>. This is Musical Theatre 101.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="524cd382-978d-4f92-b452-376ae5d45b4f">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a177fe82-331e-43f9-b9fa-2c50643a99fe">
      <Text>I hate musicals.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ba469e7-47f6-474a-8298-1e961d825b83">
      <Text>Lulu approaches Jacob, who is dressed as Wednesday from </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">The Addams Family</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5f9638ff-84c5-4902-8ceb-bca25ca4aaa4">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fc0532ae-6bed-402a-b75d-2d178f2aaa4f">
      <Text>Wednesday, Jud Fry is against everything you stand for.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="05871122-2b37-4f86-a4cd-9317c4c2ed86">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="63e529ce-bfd4-45ac-b9f1-9e2de3fd78be">
      <Text>At least I get to stand at the end unlike Jud Fry. By the way, isn’t this so inspiring to you as a musical writer?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a02932d6-afb1-41bd-b48c-82d15202fb01">
      <Text>A bell rings in the distance.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b26142ed-5b44-4d2e-aa6b-caa579ea58f3">
      <Text>Jacob heads to his post.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dbc133cf-ed37-4eed-bbcc-c98b21748e5a">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1d0dadb4-0e1b-4496-a00f-bb5422548ff0">
      <Text>How’s that musical you’re writing?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8d21f126-31fa-445c-834f-18b2d2925d97">
      <Text>Lulu pulls out a giant scrapbook with deer stickers.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a0e40d02-8524-4960-815e-f26b4bb317f0">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42669ddc-6589-477d-8499-2d8928b5f56f">
      <Text Style="Italic">Dearborn the musical</Text>
      <Text>! It’ll have its showcase at my middle school fall talent show! Emma’s gonna play Mama Deer, Lukas is Papa Deer, Camille is Cathy Dee- Oh! And Dionne’s uh Lake Superior, Lee’s gonna be Huron-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ae92925d-72ab-4d77-a241-0a9dbe1f099c">
      <Text>Petoskey grows bored and walks away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8e205e39-760e-4a6a-896d-c29a50e1067a">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ca3fe212-d024-4a8b-8403-b16361c2ba0b">
      <Text>Where ya goin’?! Eh, I’ll have you singing like a canary in front of the family in due time.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7a95a869-cff6-4dcc-a1d6-1689b20dff5b">
      <Text>[Before marching, Lulu shares her rare findings to the family.]














</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="2" Page="41" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">13. “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Fraudway</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20913679-555b-4ed6-bcf2-08703cd8980c">
      <Text>As Perry drives the Ford Model T, Willy sits in the passenger side, and Cherry is in the back seat in the most elaborate costume ever.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="81668e64-8313-4e66-8f3c-64625e28fa1a">
      <Text>[To spite Petoskey, Lulu breaks his father's necklace, unaware it was their only chance to save the Lake House from Wayland.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0bdf7fd6-b1bb-43c8-806f-797fa6fd514d">
      <Text>




































</Text>    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="20913679-555b-4ed6-bcf2-08703cd8980c">
      <Text>The parade reaches BANH </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MIchigan</Text>
      <Text> restaurant. Jasper is handing out food with the Tran family.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="609b88a3-0e8a-496a-ad56-f9f35b52c2b1">
      <Text>Lulu waves at Jasper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="240b2a10-a093-4dee-9322-84b98a490ba5">
      <Text>PetoskEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="3777a97d-aa60-439d-b8c6-13c149fd0389">
      <Text>You’re not taking my godfather too!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4f13053f-ae16-4e79-a033-590a8d7cf7b2">
      <Text>Petoskey punches Lulu. It is never a good look for Jud Fry to beat up the broken-armed Evan Hansen.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5596a099-52f4-4ab1-8ead-59d910bd61be">
      <Text>Liz and Shelby try to break up the fight. Suddenly, a memory washes over them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="33c058a9-1a33-4194-9779-7dbbb2aa2e30">
      <Text>Petey comes out of nowhere and hurts Shelby. Liz redirects her attention to them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f609a6e7-8958-48e5-b9ff-f17f648fa539">
      <Text>Petey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6f11228c-f933-46fd-b2a4-94d20d2d175e">
      <Text>They stole our jobs and my little sister, too!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="744da910-d555-4d1d-92c3-91e3fd3287d3">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="37d71bf2-74b5-4007-af9b-e13424d0e0a1">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Petos</Text>
      <Text>- Petey, stop! Get your hands off her!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="93137d8a-1f4e-423e-b98f-bc7756ff4ee3">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5df6c189-54c6-4dff-ae3f-9337e5b28d1c">
          <Text>PETEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e8d166fc-4b19-4cb2-93e7-e6ff57ae22b8">
          <Text>She... She...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb75f207-79e6-4182-98c9-560963ea5eb3">
          <Text>PetoskEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="49407fe6-36cb-4463-9404-811b206eec96">
          <Text>She... She...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="36b04f62-8a9e-4748-85a8-e6ea08036dd7">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b911ceb9-13ba-4620-a7ed-6084c6b96cd5">
      <Text>Her husband is a loving hardworking man. Even if he’s a transplant. If you cannot accept her love into your family, I cannot accept joining yours ever again.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="c6657722-f99b-4c72-a787-7a4a8db5c8c5">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="86c9887b-5866-4fc9-82cc-7e99b59b587f">
          <Text>PETEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a6957765-ef65-4ec5-89b4-dff48ea688f0">
          <Text>I... I...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccb49acb-1814-430d-b7c2-e8858e0528b3">
          <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a723569c-28af-4886-80bb-c8c474c60d0f">
          <Text>I... I...</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b4518c0-f1c2-47f4-9791-f122cf082b95">
      <Text>Petey tries to hug or kiss Liz. She dismisses and tends to Shelby.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="dbe55579-f193-4192-b5a8-e9338b5262ff">
      <Text>Petey exits and starts up the car.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d425efaf-34ee-4e60-ba77-b977b57a6375">
      <Text>In reality, Jasper pulls Petoskey away from Lulu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7af3f3cd-0c0f-4471-8edd-e662443d06eb">
      <Text>Jacob runs into the orchestra pit and blows a wind instrument.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1" Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Fraudway</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e48990b7-5f04-4724-a53a-aedd2b1fc23e">
      <Text>JacoB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="42a6f108-57b2-4d1e-81a9-c2c54534b61c">
      <Text>The parade is over! We do not condone these acts of violence. Huh... On behalf of the Harbor Days committee, I hereby revoke my family’s Most Creative Award.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="cc9f2539-2dd7-40a2-9534-53159078ab0e">
      <Text>A Resident removes the award plague from Willy’s grasp.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1 7/8" Page="43" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="VANDAMS">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">14. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Kick Rocks</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="57621cf5-ca08-4d75-9ac3-de122c5f4a1b">
      <Text>Petoskey faces Liz.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="fad65c0f-c239-4268-bd9a-622ba3adb8e0">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="e9973c1d-6b9a-405f-85a4-9a8955392447">
      <Text>Please see, mom. It’s not what it look like.
Believe me, mom. I ain’t mean to hurt her.
Don’t leave me, mom! She started everything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="29764db4-4ae4-44a6-8a26-a218c36a24db">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="f39f86a4-4bc4-4738-bf8d-2d4088b177a3">
      <Text>Son...
Go kick rocks!
Kick rocks!
It doesn’t matter who’s start it!
As my child, you know better...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f462ecd0-086c-462e-874a-9242b5a9189d">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b4c65e65-f2be-441f-acc6-abd85d1874c1">
      <Text>Violence won’t end?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="3aa05347-4a4a-484d-aa83-74aacc603fa1">
      <Text>Lizzie levels herself with Petoskey before distancing away.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8812b0dd-b0ef-433a-88ab-464a6efce7b0">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="d6f4a2ee-b835-4aae-8e9d-b11bca9d33ce">
      <Text>Son...
What matters, violence is not the answer!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cdae6a8d-e3a0-4d5e-ae14-a8bd9e348986">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="620d5fac-0417-4a6d-9545-4cc615fcbb46">
      <Text>A raging monster’s what I look like.
Been a monster, who is meant to hurt all.
Do leave this monster, who’s stoned everything.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="576974ef-ecfd-49bb-8435-9cab98cfc8cb">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="d01f61db-aaf3-4430-8c61-52420d5e6dc8">
      <Text>Son...
Go
kick rocks!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1d6fe9f2-990c-49b1-b050-526a2f636318">
      <Text>The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> join in with Liz, except Lulu who remains silent.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="699ea319-7d29-4d78-90f0-2d78bb99b6c9">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandAMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="7353e202-5013-4c2c-b6d0-945746887fdd">
      <Text>Kick rocks!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c58ce68e-3076-4643-a809-3464e9f65089">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="4f2df979-8d59-4158-9fb1-0c14d3632229">
      <Text>It doesn’t matter who’s start it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="9c59529b-00ea-4bb6-b603-25be49d4c48b">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="070ccae3-870a-4365-98fd-0f7055a1e6d7">
          <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b91b4b07-791e-4309-b8c9-fc0c36027066">
          <Text>I didn’t start it!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a4175151-66f8-449b-ae33-992edff8aae9">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandamS</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="5e522958-e3f6-4ee5-b7b2-e5c0657a2cb0">
          <Text>Who started it?</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4263d571-430c-4d14-8f7d-6a2a28231a7a">
      <Text>LizziE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="094261e8-2415-42ae-8fc1-06b60cb0914f">
      <Text>Maybe as my husband’s child, you don’t know better...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="19292c91-1d63-467c-b091-8998152f37cb">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VanDAMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="3f1ab34e-105f-469d-aed0-82628ba64068">
      <Text>The violence won’t end!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="19ae91c6-4c65-40ff-b9d5-432ee31e52f5">
      <Text>Lulu is about to lodge a punch at Petoskey. Instead, she throws Petey’s heirloom at him.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0d402df2-0c79-43a8-9afb-c8d41552be01">
      <Text>Petoskey ponders about the Mackinac Bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d34c9acb-b344-41e9-b36e-f5a705f29734">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="514032f2-5592-4f62-ac23-a83b03c1ea52">
      <Text>All that matter’s that we bridge the love...
It’s always the answer!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="314964b9-7f2c-408e-b01e-7501dc25c7ee">
      <Text>Petoskey faces a body of water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5e60cd4f-03fa-4dba-bfe8-dd5a9015532d">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="22c0f96b-5286-434c-a672-3cc225be2d0a">
      <Text>Son,
Kick rocks!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="3fca8610-0290-488e-9374-8b11a8b2c513">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="db856f69-18e3-430f-9d9b-c3bb15d9691a">
          <Text>Lizzie</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="18a0d3b5-6a0c-4b2a-85ca-07ec8c154a61">
          <Text>Kick rocks!
Why Petoskey?</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="84d75a1a-2bae-4762-a52e-891fe1bc0239">
          <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="739fdc22-8d0b-4521-9909-c7bc594fe7c0">
          <Text>Kick rocks!
Kick rocks!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ac896e9e-4aa6-4617-aba0-b8e71f4c69f2">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="27849d03-6967-43a6-a8a0-ae9b4d0dc6e2">
      <Text>Kick rocks!
Kick rocks!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0f4c4721-8578-4abb-98ce-b9d665263641">
      <Text>Liz reaches for Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8a33c0ba-d31d-4aa3-8eaa-29a00be6d02e">
      <Text>Lizzie</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ac8be4b7-28f9-4dfa-ae90-520a3305f58a">
      <Text>No!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b6e0868-c8ba-4f3c-8b26-c103c59c0f77">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">VandAMS</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="cd1ee0fb-de23-484a-b2e3-bce038d24260">
      <Text>Kick...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f5f2fd32-8ee7-4e7f-ab27-92611406cfb8">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c039ab19-50ba-4f36-a81d-7c465f7e3f30">
      <Text>Remember to float!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="897bf530-82cd-4a79-82c2-d1bbce32025b">
      <Text>LizzIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="5e075636-b6dd-4e11-bbfc-97b545cb99aa">
      <Text>Petoskey!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3e19e8d4-0a6e-4fdd-b71c-aa9028e70530">
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="62fddbeb-a542-456c-b1f8-2e2b28767eb8">
      <Text>...rocks!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f9715383-0854-4664-9534-9f9e51805c7b">
      <Text>Like his father, Petoskey leaps and sinks into the body of water.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Kick Rocks</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="End of Act" id="da1b48dc-a3cf-4bcf-9bdc-ed21a5117b1b">
      <Text>End of ACt I</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Label="Scene 1" Type="New Act" id="03254032-ba6b-4137-a15f-5226dbf7d214">
      <Text>Act </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">II</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 1</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="45" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Rapids, August 2016 - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="45" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU &amp; PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">15. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Hands Come in Handy</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="f510e3d7-488c-483e-b598-0658cdd0a828">
      <Text>The Harbor Days talent show has a handy line-up, including 7-year-old Lulu and Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a93b920-dbbf-4393-a4ec-bb010801c31e">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="dc41526d-1a1d-4ad0-823a-ad3794663e28">
      <Text>Welcome to Michigan.
Are you feeling lost?
Always remember, friend:
put your right palm up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="34b8b1ba-e007-4f8a-8f03-7307e9f6a8dd">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="a32f5a21-3975-4a7d-988e-8e09672820ec">
      <Text>Or face your left hand down!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="bfd01756-65f2-4325-890a-d34e3159e917">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="352471b5-371d-4d65-b90b-ee14812f08e2">
      <Text>Put your right palm up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="70a67fb6-b91c-4200-8b81-ac508a2a7dd4">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="68cf5550-72a2-47b9-938d-2e372d731f24">
      <Text>And your left hand over!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="c490727f-85fb-4af3-8554-fbabfd285572">
      <Text>Petoskey puts his left hand, palm facing, over Lulu’s right hand to form Michigan’s Peninsulas. They point to the respective cities.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dc232821-9747-4fa7-a8e1-1e2d2e8b0364">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ba281244-885c-4d4c-8aa3-405d91c159ce">
      <Text>Let’s start with the thumb.
Detroit, Dearborn, Warren, Port Huron, Flint, Hamtramck, Royal Oak, and DOn’t forget Ann Arbor.
Hands come in handy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b5bdd2c4-163c-4cfe-95ad-eef6d15518e5">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6e820e8d-41f5-46a7-b5f6-5d22be04b8af">
      <Text>What brings you to Michigan?
We do have the best socks!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="56ca970e-a2ec-405c-9fef-5defe214d232">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="2299fff1-7b48-413d-9bc2-3020858c9af9">
      <Text>Don’t forget the mittens!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="df5d639b-e0a8-4ac3-87f2-4decd48f2142">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="f8bf2a4b-5e16-44aa-9da5-285e15283d6d">
      <Text>Put your left palm down.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a61f6b3e-247a-47c2-9d0c-cef3981eb2a1">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="867007a7-8f82-429c-bd56-4f686699d6a6">
      <Text>Or face your </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic+AllCaps">right</Text>
      <Text> palm up!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="23dfdc76-eb8f-4c92-ae30-5305300463bf">
      <Text>PetoskEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="4ecc651c-64df-4c63-a65f-702cb37a0083">
      <Text>Put your right palm up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="72fb372b-fc67-4129-a71b-0495aa7eb212">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="94bdb2f4-cb83-4509-8dfd-53dabda6d923">
      <Text>And your left hand over!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="dde5f004-c942-4cde-aae5-27ee5f4b35f8">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="8d605edc-27b7-4688-90d8-f5b6a317af12">
      <Text>Let’s point to the palm.
Lansing, Mt. Pleasant, Saginaw, Kalamazoo, Claire, Saint Louis, Grand Rapids, and let’s forget Wyoming...
Hands come in handy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eeb3e808-2a52-497c-b7b6-0c4902332f25">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey wear Wyoming High School gears (David Quang Pham’s alma mater).</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ed70140-ee7c-4ea9-9f66-51b249dfd464">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6141dc40-9767-4704-b8de-acbef8c51f4b">
      <Text>Now around the hand...
St. Joseph, Saugatuck, Holland, Grand Haven, Muskegon, Traverse City, Alpena...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="e1725d4b-ba11-482a-b2c1-bf69522b9cf6">
      <Text>Petoskey points to himself.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1c893d77-0270-4aaf-9827-b2952229d204">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6141dc40-9767-4704-b8de-acbef8c51f4b">
      <Text>Who could forget Petoskey...?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ed70140-ee7c-4ea9-9f66-51b249dfd464">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="17c2af32-bbb2-4e35-9d11-ae25f0e0487e">
      <Text>Hands come in handy!

Now the other hand!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b179cfb0-0c96-476c-afc4-34c8b6485a36">
      <Text>Marquette, Escanaba, Houghton, Sault Ste. Marie, Mackinac, Iron Mountain, Keweenaw.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0b50bdc8-698e-4526-86d7-0d3e10f079cd">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="08589e57-3733-4f07-8484-7fa8a269330c">
      <Text>Did we forget anything?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="347fbc2c-3913-4288-94e1-2629b906983c">
      <Text>Petoskey brings out Snoopy.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b93fef17-6562-492f-886b-69f788d5ff29">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="41d51abd-49ba-4736-93b5-26d04a50eecc">
      <Text>Michigan’s Adventures!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cbfac004-6b12-4ae3-b240-e915a9c2de4f">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="a2d2a473-dc7e-447f-9918-3aeda57f4d46">
      <Text>Two parks!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="593ee300-319a-4dc2-91d1-a44c473595e2">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="7cbdf402-14e1-464d-b90d-532c7c13bbdf">
      <Text>For the price of one!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ad867be1-9fbc-4ad5-bd02-260242c3c578">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="0b6ebece-b10c-4529-bf3d-2c6d81942f0c">
      <Text>Fun! Fun!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="b8728f1d-32d4-47ca-9eff-24578fa242f4">
      <DualDialogue>
        <SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
          <IgnoredRanges/>
          <IgnoredWords/>
        </SpellCheckIgnoreLists>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e759715c-af28-4b78-b906-ac2d211390a8">
          <Text>Lulu</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="81ef9b55-3b41-4190-a7ad-c3bda8130e05">
          <Text>Michigan’s Lower Peninsula!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3a58100c-4161-4700-ae43-f0b7f2d483d7">
          <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
        </Paragraph>
        <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ee960669-6e8d-426b-83d8-986418735052">
          <Text>Michigan’s Upper Peninsula!</Text>
        </Paragraph>
      </DualDialogue>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f9f5b810-9351-4843-9b7a-06ca0b04be3e">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="027a7989-a01a-4436-ba6e-cbecf7120334">
      <Text>for a thousand townships, townships!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="eb131d90-865c-47e4-96b0-d446e778a6b9">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey go into the audience and applaud them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2a4cea27-9b65-4a32-a48e-62fd06d3635a">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="0e86c12f-18a4-400d-9db9-34f13d151f07">
      <Text>Applaud each other!
Applaud yourselves!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="470b3c01-ac8e-4365-bae0-10ef8e1e8870">
      <Text>
love Michigan!
Don’t ever feel lost!
Remember to use your hands!
Hands come in handy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb07026c-f15e-4940-907f-1464871cdfb3">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="017b9aa4-4d37-458b-a1a4-801670d7c385">
      <Text>Put your right palm up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8691ff57-6871-4b85-9a93-8a67f40ccd2a">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="dded2373-ad3e-49db-a4e2-b6d427e56768">
      <Text>Left hand over!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="81c2734f-b294-4c13-ac28-902edb76f605">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="1768cf7b-0618-4c21-b569-623a9829d7a1">
      <Text>Hands come in handy!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="6c0f2dc4-19c3-48a6-9e20-dc3539726c5e">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey do a Pat-a-cake, pat-a-cake, baker’s man game.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Hands Come in Handy</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 2</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="4/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Elk Lake House, August 2022 - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="88cf1133-89ce-46cc-86ec-3a2420807ff6">
      <Text>Liz watches the 2016 recording of Lulu and Petoskey’s handy song.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="eb417a85-ff6c-40b1-b48e-e699118839fb">
      <Text>LizziE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="4c88ce84-7759-415a-8922-4101a3138bbc">
      <Text>I guess Petoskey could be anywhere!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bee9e2e7-56fe-4397-8573-63226302e55e">
      <Text>Cherry and Perry check in.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b3849735-ebbb-4d3f-a2f2-82a526aaac98">
      <Text>LizZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1af2cd03-d218-4cb3-bfab-c132e8f254cc">
      <Text>My son?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="96be60ce-7744-4731-bd16-36ae32c86802">
      <Text>CherRY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5a70ed6b-bc9c-40bb-afb2-cd03b224e4f7">
      <Text>No luck.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4f4fc614-62f5-438b-abbd-d37393ec16cf">
      <Text>Perry</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="133eb483-2124-4439-b81b-f7a5bad4f8a9">
      <Text>You should’ve named him Limestone. He would’ve been easier to find.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e7a1fbfc-8b7a-4e2b-a9d9-b49f8cf4ffe1">
      <Text>LizziE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="58656f3e-921a-4ac8-8ac3-b283c11d71c0">
      <Text>Science is not helping.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="3759c1b5-0b08-4f48-b01d-62d6667b7542">
      <Text>CherrY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cfb74221-1402-4734-aa25-ee2bf5637043">
      <Text>When did it ever?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="47" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Lake House - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a1eda5c5-1d20-4950-9be7-096b94e33ee0">
      <Text>Cherry and Perry go outside to find many search parties.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="48" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">16. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Petoskey</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08">
      <Text>[Presently, they search for him while Lulu tries to find him at BANH MI (“Petoskey”).]




























</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="472e0421-fa1b-422b-a8ef-bf8ea4af3592">
      <Text>


















</Text>    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Petoskey</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 3</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="6/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Int. Banh Michigan - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="8b8bd764-bf81-4cac-b3d7-e0d0ba45dc3f">
      <Text>Lulu enters the restaurant and sits by Jasper on the phone.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="4ea4ee2c-a410-4430-8ea6-20482f76388c">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="67f7c926-d45c-4674-a3e9-882593ea8f34">
      <Text>You won’t accept the cash prize? Fine. I’ll give you the BANH </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MIchigan</Text>
      <Text> secret formula if you find him. Of course </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">alive</Text>
      <Text>, you sicko.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="45a883a1-16bb-4fd0-b1bf-e3ef37ff94fa">
      <Text>Jasper hangs up.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2d00a145-d7d9-40d2-ab6a-87e5d911bf42">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="6295d8b4-6958-47c0-aa55-9ec07820c17a">
      <Text>You found Petoskey?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0ac8f328-0fa4-4c21-8b44-ea091c47ae2a">
      <Text>Lulu faces down on the table, crying.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d92c8b14-ce21-4c67-bd45-a35e4fd9e86c">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="e401d35c-fd55-4981-a7ef-35791e516291">
      <Text>Don’t lose yourself, Lulu...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69d3f9a5-7701-446d-8879-3c1946b997b6">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5500362f-c06f-4137-80db-a8020a81ddc5">
      <Text>I lost my cousin. I lost my family. I lost all hope.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08">
      <Text>[Jasper shares his refugee family stayed united despite continents dividing them as well as a time when a Lebanese family bought out his family’s failing restaurant but did not resort to blame as Petey had. The </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Vandams</Text>
      <Text> are only divided by peninsulas.]</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ed09c4f3-ae75-4e55-b655-363b0131bb69">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="caf45bd5-f5ca-4a75-a743-54d92069464b">
      <Text>You know what my family always said?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="08117c90-7477-4be2-b738-1f3500b09d10">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="1126b697-8c7f-4a71-83b2-230f5d2ca6f6">
      <Text>No, I don’t.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="2b317a2f-acac-442b-b0d3-0eb725b26d30">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 3/8" Page="49" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JACOB">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LIZZIE">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU &amp; JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">17. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">North South East West</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1e5ac6a4-9b13-42c3-b18c-7bfc0c107eb2">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="473ef626-ae91-4f95-aac7-bc9cf183b758">
      <Text>Your family said what?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6d65d6d3-6961-4871-bc67-97be8b74ed09">
      <Text>Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="1febed95-7f5e-4d68-9603-02c0d08b973a">
      <Text>North south east or west.
It doesn’t matter where you come from
as long as you break bread.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b31c6514-e36c-42fc-b3a2-cecdee7565cd">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="bea03e0d-e6b2-4d1a-87bb-838d37b4e50c">
      <Text>You and ya banh mi </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">needa</Text>
      <Text> give it a rest.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9823d57-cd8c-4628-a0ad-247c4a126337">
      <Text>Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="86d4addf-8f13-4e46-8c40-548b84ee09fe">
      <Text>Someone’s compass ain’t passing my test.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="21508e86-f8a2-4b82-a40d-f32e9f5f7bcd">
      <Text>Jacob enters the restaurant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="878bd4c8-146e-4e3e-9234-9ca0634d85ae">
      <Text>JacOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="ec0fa881-1436-4fd7-a108-84b8399a3bd5">
      <Text>Shalom.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d005dea7-76fc-4ab1-b5fa-9f07c95c4e5c">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="dd031c27-b136-4ecd-9072-ed55f5f23e9a">
      <Text>Bonjour!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="157e2983-2944-4292-81e9-0a3f662b6b8d">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="badc9a18-16a9-4ad8-9e95-1821be14248f">
      <Text>Chau, Jacob!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="18a48328-6a4f-4968-8668-fbf6b35940a5">
      <Text>JacOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="566a4267-8168-4062-8082-50f76fbbba1e">
      <Text>Looking for our missing cousin worked me up an appetite.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="77806d73-c196-42c5-b3c3-28c12cb083e8">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b1bae192-a376-4717-92f5-5303a39c9fe2">
      <Text>I’m sure kosher will give us closure.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e323e7f2-0c2c-4b17-89dd-dd3951b4d991">
      <Text>JacOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="7594e106-20b8-4d92-8eae-113771d7790e">
      <Text>Make my bread a bridge roll.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ccad97d-cb56-4ea2-913a-9b641742371e">
      <Text>Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b1e17b85-c25d-49b8-bf58-fe7963ec357e">
      <Text>Not feeling french today?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="d1f1be46-0a6b-4866-bbd0-f82f45c4552c">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="9eb7ba6e-8a2e-451f-a4a0-d9c4721eefa7">
      <Text>The british invasion was so yesterday.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="5b2cc4d8-2fa3-4d51-8feb-f19c194e29b6">
      <Text>Jasper makes a banh mi for Jacob.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b44701df-e438-41d6-8926-46a21e28590e">
      <Text>Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="c5d92138-2f72-4ece-8390-4a847f081f96">
      <Text>North south east or west.
I don’t care if you’re straight or curved
so long as you try them baguettes.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c2242d3e-9c25-4b9f-ab02-4098079e1f2e">
      <Text>Jacob</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="8de81e48-3270-46df-9795-2cc752f9431c">
      <Text>Just cause I do musical theatre does not make me gay. Look at Lulu, wanting to be a musical writer, does that make her-</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="35fdd772-2573-493c-b974-93eeafecb220">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5945d8e3-abd3-4045-bdeb-e0b0fd322988">
      <Text>Yup, I’m gay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e93421be-d409-478a-88fc-b4ed29be8079">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a2c5161a-6a7f-491e-988d-583a7cfc33ae">
      <Text>Open-and-shut case.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="516f5768-4fae-416e-a6a1-1b89f8959b37">
      <Text>JacOB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="89c3c2f5-60ff-4c74-ad4c-52dcba832514">
      <Text>Okay...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="6b09abce-6454-4162-ae06-815cab74335e">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="5e9ab233-c3c8-4af0-880e-717357d767ac">
      <Text>Banh mi turned me gay.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="661272fc-9c84-4457-a793-7857c7da2205">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a266d298-2787-4c75-bde0-629f94e113b9">
      <Text>Case back open...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="82abba51-5590-4374-a0d1-49c8403fb80d">
      <Text>JacoB</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="068a77e7-75e2-4a56-bc8e-c5012004585b">
      <Text>Haha! Welp...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="2978d5fd-0809-4bad-b069-25f76d4af764">
      <Text>Toda for the bridge!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="74263e6f-392a-4b54-8149-ae7379ce10af">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="652c0560-a7ab-454e-bd3e-e20740b9cfbd">
      <Text>The bridge?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5727747c-3e55-4748-bd5a-fd30164c0532">
      <Text>Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="bf293977-27ef-48b3-8374-8d0f5c8d7d42">
      <Text>The mackinac Bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="31ddd29b-1f23-4f62-b185-ec8206114f01">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="b7016fc7-11d5-4c9a-ac5d-feaf3a3c10e7">
      <Text>The Mackinac Bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="41571462-040f-42bf-bbfc-21d9edf1338e">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="3c3cae40-a78c-4217-b42b-92c6797cea9d">
      <Text>The Mackinac bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a1626d18-4fb5-400c-902e-e2ae10342902">
      <Text>LulU</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="32caf85d-4fc6-4b8e-96c9-518c60d96aae">
      <Text>The Mackinac.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7af51471-25b4-4ddc-b1ce-a4a955168a8c">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; JASPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="bf172f9d-a91b-489b-85f2-17f81e6b204e">
      <Text>The Mackinac Bridge.

North south east or west.
It doesn’t matter where you go
so long as you listen to the bread.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">North South East West</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="78e39458-698c-4318-913f-d08a0df4a211">
      <Text>Liz enters the restaurant.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1cfa436f-d54d-45ef-ae65-4b20a02a40ca">
      <Text>Lulu &amp; Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="276a9b40-ab1e-47b6-82e4-d27457eb8c8b">
      <Text>We know where Petoskey is.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e793b374-e9ea-45b5-a9e4-028a34d53af7">
      <Text>Lizzie</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f09e42c3-ed5c-4a2d-8362-e695a52482f1">
      <Text>I have a feeling, it’s...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="255f85b2-dbf7-4c86-a758-f6e8ecee48cb">
      <Text>JASPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="3c46f1c2-da99-43eb-acc6-2673234d2ec8">
      <Text>The bridge...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="78aed66d-60e7-4aa2-8cc4-63b8d4b69d9d">
      <Text>LIZZIE</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ecc9085a-6c59-4880-8a64-e3542fee1a4b">
      <Text>I...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="b425b079-b186-4053-8b15-344cb6ec2570">
      <Text>JasPER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="541ab841-63c4-406f-8531-4d4441df5d8e">
      <Text>I’ll go to Mackinac for you.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c1a3d283-47c5-4236-87de-04942af9c3d0">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="d5291259-3b82-45a3-8b63-19205d24566a">
      <Text>And I need to go apologize...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="0482a0a1-29eb-4489-add7-1b09c6d2b5bd">
      <Text>Liz punches her hand into her other hand. Lulu acknowledges it.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7e7bbeee-2632-4901-9cd5-686c75bb82ec">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a5ae1872-fea2-438e-b741-af1b72ddb8c2">
      <Text>Apologize with some deserved violence.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="a4f5c8f3-4899-483b-8495-ff8167282227">
      <Text>Jasper kisses a banh mi.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="efd41c3f-7e2c-43c5-84a6-91b643cb43c1">
      <Text>JaspER</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f7cd1054-1a6e-438a-a03d-acbae8fc5846">
      <Text>Banh mi, you never fail me!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bd470467-f960-4685-90d9-ebf0c8b1071e">
      <Text>Lulu and Jasper run out.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 4</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="52" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Mackinac Bridge - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9db8ffae-33d8-4f33-9d0f-55621098fec0">
      <SceneProperties Length="1" Page="52" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">18. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Rock Bottom</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="1ae32e91-a180-4083-84f5-14dec04b18d5">
      <Text>Petoskey looks down at the strait.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="e0299ee3-7520-45be-af7d-678c6121e84a">
      <Text>Petoskey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="f1e9fb25-4a23-4a7a-816c-2ad7fcb5b110">
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08">
      <Text>[Lulu and Jasper drive up to find him. She offers the broken stone as a truce.]





































</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="7d88f38a-07cb-4f7b-9b86-5486e570929e">
      <Text>Petoskey chucks the heirloom, surprising Lulu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Rock Bottom</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9db8ffae-33d8-4f33-9d0f-55621098fec0">
      <SceneProperties Length="2 5/8" Page="53" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="LULU, PETOSKEY, JASPER">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="PETOSKEY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
          </CharacterArcBeat>
        </SceneArcBeats>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">19. “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Family’s in the Fossils</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline+AllCaps">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="b511e680-a079-4779-865a-b0033e0eb855">
      <Text>The bridge fogs up, separating Petoskey from Lulu and Jasper.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="766fe7ab-d8be-48ae-a5ce-d11a1fe4ddbf">
      <Text>In the mist, a </Text>
      <Text Style="AllCaps">Giant Elk</Text>
      <Text> towers Petoskey. He cowers below them.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="33e54f8b-3b4e-47b1-8012-d2566cd3df8c">
      <Text>Petey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="6362e6f0-6760-4249-9605-d10258fdf898">
      <Text>Wakey </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wakey</Text>
      <Text>, son...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="8b2288c7-da53-4a4a-b9a4-b33ab6c74f1c">
      <Text>PetosKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Lyrics" id="48f94997-6298-4096-8474-60686c74e429">
      <Text>Wakey </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">wakey</Text>
      <Text>... Petey? Dad?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="64b6e0f4-bc58-47ac-8014-8c746ebbe84f">
      <Text>Petey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a3983c89-a15a-4971-bef9-83ff4da54c76">
      <Text>Turning into an elk, I gained a couple hundred pounds. But luckily, I’m a </Text>
      <Text Style="Italic">ghost</Text>
      <Text>!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="d8cd64a7-7073-4cf5-9d8e-99af812ea582">
      <Text>Petey awaits laughter.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="da936d36-0221-493f-97c1-6812261bb926">
      <Text>Petey</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="970ba32c-e2fc-4f27-97ed-ab1cfafbcbaf">
      <Text>I guess you’re not used to dad jokes...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c094aaa0-69e6-4d92-a7c0-1ba65cfe2ae3">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2803f345-3eed-4376-b01b-4ccad23f5862">
      <Text>Nah, I’m used to Jasper’s.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cc35cc2e-1bc9-4ad3-8385-b7d814a1c345">
      <Text>PETEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="88874dfa-291b-4d14-8d07-02ce29ff2ed0">
      <Text>How is he? Still run that restaurant?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="5d9a5d0b-4a87-4fd8-9ce3-e97d3a2ad929">
      <Text>PetoSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="476e01b9-4b7b-4ca2-bd2e-ef2b87c978e4">
      <Text>BANH </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MIchigan</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a9599b25-6127-47ba-a786-351c6d476bc7">
      <Text>PETEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="789e3a6c-79df-4a96-bcea-42c5f441283b">
      <Text>There’s unlimited Banh Mi in the afterlife, but it doesn’t hit like BANH </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">MIchigan</Text>
      <Text>.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="ccf10cc6-5aec-465a-871d-09ebaf81112a">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="26122ec1-5b7c-49b5-9f99-4c9b079f8903">
      <Text>And unlimited souls?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="7abdb24a-bd11-4e6c-ae7a-a1a6ef6c2bb6">
      <Text>PETEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="cc2829b4-3bf8-4bf6-a833-ede57c1c1d6a">
      <Text>Yeah, but never one like your mom. Lizzie.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="0982bd2c-ef5d-462a-94ae-128aa03503de">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="474420d9-274b-4042-876b-4da663fa3450">
      <Text>Dad, why did you leave her? Us?</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="c0e8897b-8ce0-4395-b636-0e60e4a1b619">
      <Text>PETEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="ed9de7f1-60eb-423a-abb0-638f31101b81">
      <Text>Son, there’s more to life than the house. And obviously more to my niece than you thought.  </Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a747c995-78db-4e33-9e08-bf93f90c3059">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="a90e3d89-844e-4a98-9f4b-c73061911032">
      <Text>Lulu and I will never get along...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="f3202494-5ec1-4389-aec2-243eb1369b83">
      <Text>PETEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="11437103-70c1-4f84-8940-5af37bcde40c">
      <Text>I only wished my younger sister Shelby and I had a friendship like her daughter and yours.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08"/>
    <Paragraph Type="General" id="7ceeb8b7-fb36-4c60-bda0-604d0f0f6d08">
      <Text>[Petey shares that stones are special only when rocks are packed together. Like family, living things come and go to leave a mark as a fossil (“Family’s in the Fossils”).


















































</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="1.25" RightIndent="7.25" SpaceBefore="12" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No" Type="General" id="eb856690-b1a3-4f35-8b5f-8c2819a62116">
      <Text Style="Underline">End of “</Text>
      <Text Color="#00000000FEFE" Style="Underline+AllCaps">Family’s in the FOssils</Text>
      <Text Style="Underline">”</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="bc3e70ab-9e26-4192-b4ea-2ddac931f58e">
      <Text>The fog clears up, showing a confused Lulu and confident Petoskey.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="fdd03e60-7d6a-4e7c-9261-625f56d3df7e">
      <Text>Petoskey runs up and hugs Lulu.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="cb869fc3-2cf0-4729-98bd-0a1250366847">
      <Text>Lulu</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="31641d83-08a6-45d7-9459-a136ceb3b736">
      <Text>I’d punch you off this bridge...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="69fb0c61-c91b-49e2-9e91-9237a25065bc">
      <Text>PETOSKEY</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="b7c10493-1612-4e79-b949-08c69ab67102">
      <Text>Thanks for having mercy on me...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="4d9191f0-1b7b-4b10-802d-9823d9a4ffe4">
      <Text>Lulu and Petoskey walk away from the Mackinac Bridge.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="ffa09fe9-c877-411d-a1f3-bd2b110bc345">
      <Text>A punch is audible.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="613b328c-481c-4cfe-8a0d-19d555e8d68e">
      <Text>PetoSKEY (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="fadd2a8b-5796-475e-9fcd-ba32a2188156">
      <Text>Ouch! </Text>
      <Text AdornmentStyle="-1">Ope</Text>
      <Text>...</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="a2d02ce1-90da-409e-b4ea-c2074dcb3aa7">
      <Text>Lulu (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="65938e91-19ce-40f3-bb68-4bf77f8c107b">
      <Text>Told ya I’d punch ya off the bridge!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="1f192d73-99ff-4396-861a-43ef7a22bd1b">
      <Text>Jasper (O.S.)</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="7027a33a-bcdb-4656-bb71-11c61f9289ec">
      <Text>Hold your vengeance for Amanda Wayland and her cronies!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Character" id="2ac4573a-308b-4691-9f88-a5dda3840d89">
      <Text>Lulu, Petoskey, Jasper</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Dialogue" id="2463c76c-b27b-4c37-8e41-d615713d8a89">
      <Text>Let’s save Elk Rapids!</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Action" id="2a349491-f395-4b3b-b9dc-f9f79a1e09cf">
      <Text>They drive off.</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Info" id="bfda984e-c564-4342-b53d-a7ca9637fe52">
      <Text Style="Bold+Underline+AllCaps">Scene 5</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="ff2224c8-4acc-4956-867a-17fd275c56b8">
      <SceneProperties Length="1/8" Page="55" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats/>
      </SceneProperties>
      <Text Style="Bold+AllCaps">Ext. Elk Rapids - Day</Text>
    </Paragraph>
    <Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" id="9db8ffae-33d8-4f33-9d0f-55621098fec0">
      <SceneProperties Length="5 1/8" Page="55" Title="">
        <SceneArcBeats>
          <CharacterArcBeat Name="CHERRY">
            <Paragraph Alignment="Left" FirstIndent="0.00" Leading="Regular" LeftIndent="0.00" OutlineLevel="0" RightIndent="1.39" SpaceBefore="0" Spacing="1" StartsNewPage="No"/>
